  characterId: miko
  displayName: SHRINE MAIDEN
  subtitle: Seal the Path Ahead
  role: SEALER
  flavorText: 'An exorcist of a mountain shrine.

    She lays ofuda and barriers
    ahead,

    and the path itself turns against her foes -

    but she is slow
    to strike first.'
